OL,3,GNEWSABeauty spot safety warning for
OL,4,Aswimmers as low water levels reveal
OL,5,Ahidden hazards
OL,6,
OL,7,FPeople have been warned to stay away
OL,8,Ffrom a popular beauty spot pond used
OL,9,Ffor swimming and other water sports due
OL,10,Fto "hidden hazards" exposed by reduced
OL,11,Fwater levels.
OL,13,FKeepers Pond in Abergavenny poses
OL,14,Fserious safety risks with levels
OL,15,Fdangerously low, according to Bannau
OL,16,FBrycheiniog National Park, also known
OL,17,Fas the Brecon Beacons.
OL,19,FIt said that along with the prolonged
OL,20,Fdry spell, the water had been used to
OL,21,Ftackle recent wildfires.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
