OL,3,GNEWSABeauty spot safety warning for
OL,4,Aswimmers as low water levels reveal
OL,5,Ahidden hazards
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe pond is also a protected scheduled
OL,8,Fmonument and nothing should be removed,
OL,9,Fit said in a Facebook post.
